<TITLE>Radiator Grille &amp; Emblem</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>The radiator grille of 2GR-FE engine models has a precise mesh shape (dark gray metallic), and the outer frame is chrome-plated to create a sense of luxury.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>On models with a millimeter wave radar sensor assembly<HINTREF REFID = "H403130003K33401"/>, a millimeter wave transmissive grille cover<HINTREF     REFID = "H403130003K33402"/> has been provided at the emblem.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<HINT>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT ID = "H403130003K33401">Only models w/ pre-crash safety system + radar cruise control system</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT ID = "H403130003K33402">Cover that transmits the radar waves emitted from the millimeter wave radar sensor assembly</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></HINT>
